  71:Cpp_Core/Src/gamepad/GamepadState.cpp ****  * @brief Filter diagonals out of the dpad, making the device work as a 4-way lever.
  72:Cpp_Core/Src/gamepad/GamepadState.cpp ****  *
  73:Cpp_Core/Src/gamepad/GamepadState.cpp ****  * The most recent cardinal direction wins.
